# Generated knowledge/runtime persistence
# Durable governed artifacts such as evidence, review-batches,
# and review-policies remain tracked explicitly.
#
# MS-2026-0007: runtime-data is generated, except the governed records the
# Chief Agent's activation rests on, which are tracked where Runtime keeps
# them: every certification and authorization, the records they are derived
# from, the designated Day-0 replay with its historical correlation, and the
# acquired conversations Day-0 coverage is re-proved from. A fresh clone
# re-derives exactly what this machine does. Other replays, correlations,
# browser recovery and test data stay ignored. scripts/verify-governed-records.mjs
# (part of npm run build) fails if a governed record is ignored, including a
# newly designated replay: add its two folders below.
runtime-data/*
!runtime-data/knowledge-education/
!runtime-data/genesis/
runtime-data/genesis/*
!runtime-data/genesis/runtime-replay-designation.json
!runtime-data/genesis/day-zero-certification/
!runtime-data/genesis/day-zero-conversation-coverage-certification/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-acquisition/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-authoritative-completeness-certification/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-expected-history/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-expected-history-amendments/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-expected-history-candidate/
!runtime-data/genesis/conversation-expected-history-candidate-review/
!runtime-data/genesis/replays/
runtime-data/genesis/replays/*
!runtime-data/genesis/replays/07088856c6038fc0b727252d79851528c275606c86be5d688e0c7e72b796c2dc/
!runtime-data/genesis/historical-correlation/
runtime-data/genesis/historical-correlation/*
!runtime-data/genesis/historical-correlation/07088856c6038fc0b727252d79851528c275606c86be5d688e0c7e72b796c2dc/
